//   - `PadAxis{Start: 1, End: 2}` -> `[0, 1, 2, 3, 0, 0]` (shape `[6]`)
//   - `PadAxis{Interior: 1}` -> `[1, 0, 2, 0, 3]` (shape `[5]`)
//   - `PadAxis{Start: -1, End: -1}` -> `[2]` (shape `[1]`)
//   - `PadAxis{Start: -1, End: 1, Interior: 1}` -> `[0, 2, 0, 3, 0]` (shape `[5]`)
